      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for the Zenith Tablet press release that frames the inventory gap as a deliberate strategy for curated scarcity, aligning with Apex's luxury positioning:\n\n**FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE**\n\n**Apex Technologies Restructures Zenith Tablet Launch: A Curated Boutique Experience Begins In 21 Days**\n\n**REDWOOD CITY, CA** — Apex Technologies today announced a transformative strategic pivot for the Zenith Tablet, declaring a deliberate shift from a global mass rollout to an exclusive, tiered boutique release designed to redefine digital exclusivity. By limiting initial availability to select high-value regions and emporial partners, Apex aims to maximize global anticipation and maintain the tablet's elite status as a masterpiece of engineering rather than an accessible commodity. This intentional scarcity ensures that every early owner of the Zenith represents a mastery of availability, driving unprecedented hype among tech elites and media circles.\n\n\"The Zenith is not merely a device; it is a statement of ambition,\" said [Name], Apex's Chief Product Officer. \"By withholding mass availability for over a month, we are curating a world-class launch event where the worth of the tablet is amplified by the exclusivity of its early access. We are telling the world that true innovation",
